From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:22:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add HEVC encoder support

Add c2.v4l2.hevc.encoder, enabled with
ro.vendor.v4l2_codec2.encoder.supported.hevc:

- Main profile, levels 1 to 5.1, 4.1 by default.
- No B-frames, max QP 51, parameter sets joined with the first frame.
- Refresh type IDR: with the default, the Exynos MFC codes key frames
  as TRAIL_R slices, where no decoder can start or seek.
- The VPS, SPS and PPS in front of the first slice are the codec config
  data, as SPS and PPS are for H.264.

Assisted-by: LLM
